43:["$","p","95",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Email authentication in 2026 isn't a \"set-and-forget\" DNS task. It's an ongoing discipline -- requiring quarterly reviews, vendor coordination, and proactive reporting analysis. A single misconfigured `include` or expired DKIM key can drop your inbox rate by 50% overnight."]}]
